index fa1a2d5..a6b5a0a 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -8,6 +8,26 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- Rejected tool input now emits a warning naming the failed property path and constraint
+  without including the rejected value.
+
+- Dynamic tool definitions reuse compiled validators for the same schema object while
+  validating each call against its currently resolved schema.
+
+- Tool input validation loads the Ajv constructor through its CommonJS entry point and
+  reports failed constraints and property paths across supported Ajv error shapes without
+  exposing rejected values.
+
+- Static tool execution reuses the validator compiled at registration without reading the schema again.
+
+- Tool calls missing required input now return a readable rejection to the model before
+  invoking the executor.
+
+- Static tool schemas are now compiled when registered. Invalid JSON Schemas fail
+  immediately with the tool name, instead of remaining unnoticed until use.
+
 ## [0.3.0] - 2026-09-17
 
 ### Changed
